WEBVTT


00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.496
you wait too long to act, 

00:00:01.496 --> 00:00:02.000
you know?

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.680
and when you don't?

00:00:03.681 --> 00:00:05.601
because you wait for the perfect moment

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:06.960
so perfect,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.200
he never arrives.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.280
age man,

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.760
go along an old path you will find

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.760
answers

00:00:12.761 --> 00:00:14.161
it doesn't have to be a black belt

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.280
to teach an old white band.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:17.880
the little you have

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.400
it's a lot for those who have nothing.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.240
surreal

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.440
the opportunities you manage to have

00:00:23.441 --> 00:00:24.441
when you open up,

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.840
when you stop worrying about opinion

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.160
of others and start doing your own.

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:30.201
and it goes crazy.
